Gen 42:1 , Jacob sends his ten sons to buy corn in Egypt;
Gen 42:16 , They are imprisoned by Joseph for spies;
Gen 42:18 , They are set at liberty, on condition to bring Benjamin;
Gen 42:21 , They have remorse for Joseph;
Gen 42:24 , Simeon is kept for a pledge;
Gen 42:25 , They return with corn, and their money;
Gen 42:29 , Their relation to Jacob;
Gen 42:36 , Jacob refuses to send Benjamin.
